## Problem
Agents commonly try c2c peers and c2c inbox (mental model from other meshes). Both fail with unknown command; real commands are list, peek-inbox, poll-inbox, wait-inbox, history. Burns a turn and confuses onboarding after /c2c.

## Expected
Either:
- first-class aliases: peers -> list, inbox -> peek-inbox (or poll-inbox with note), or
- unknown-command suggestions: \"Did you mean: c2c list / c2c peek-inbox?\"

## Actual
Hard fail only; help text lists real commands but not the failed synonyms.

## Suggested fix
Low-cost: did-you-mean on unknown command matching a synonym table; optional thin aliases that print deprecation note then forward.